# Build once, render everywhere

Surfspace compiles a single typed `.surf` source into web pages, decks, papers,
and native apps. The `type: web` document routes through the same multipage
engine as `type: website` — byte-for-byte identical output.

::testimonial[author="Ada" role="Engineer" company="Surfspace"]
The same source renders themed everywhere.
::

